 "text": "Hi! How's life treating you? About six to seven days before the first meeting. That gives people enough time to plan. August is busy. I'd aim for the first week of September, or the last week of August, if you can. mixed bag. Some people still like a physical reminder, especially with busy families. That's lovely. A printed list in the kitchen can be the real winner. Keep them short and personal. Hi, looking forward to seeing you all. Please let me know if you' vegetarian so I can order the right burgers.",
